It depends on how you make it rustproof. If you read a non-cursed scroll 
of enchant weapon/armor while confused, it'll remove all rust. If you 
read a cursed scroll of destroy armor while confused, it'll rustproof 
the armor, but not remove any existing rust. You can also dip a weapon 
in potions of oil, which will remove rust, but not rustproof anything. 
With the exception of the oil thing, this also goes for 
burning/rotting/corroding.

